  "label": "The use of zombie apocalypse tropes to depict a social dystopia",
  "description": "Zombie apocalypse tropes are often used to depict a social dystopia, where societal norms and structures have broken down. In the meme, the zombie apocalypse is used to depict a social dystopia where racially motivated violence is rampant, thereby justifying or minimizing its impact. This requires understanding of the use of zombie apocalypse tropes in depicting social dystopias and its implications.",
